AWS <pre><code>resource "aws_organizations_organization" "this" {
  feature_set = "ALL"

  aws_service_access_principals = [
    "cloudtrail.amazonaws.com",
    "sso.amazonaws.com",
  ]

  enabled_policy_types = ["SERVICE_CONTROL_POLICY"]
}

resource "aws_organizations_organizational_unit" "workloads" {
  name      = "Workloads"
  parent_id = aws_organizations_organization.this.roots[0].id
}

resource "aws_organizations_account" "prod" {
  name      = "shopbd-prod"
  email     = "ops+shopbd-prod@example.com"
  parent_id = aws_organizations_organizational_unit.workloads.id
}

resource "aws_organizations_policy" "region_guard" {
  name    = "region-guard"
  type    = "SERVICE_CONTROL_POLICY"
  content = file("${path.module}/scp-region-guard.json")
}

resource "aws_organizations_policy_attachment" "workloads" {
  policy_id = aws_organizations_policy.region_guard.id
  target_id = aws_organizations_organizational_unit.workloads.id
}
</code></pre>

GCP <pre><code>resource "google_folder" "shopbd" {
  display_name = "shopbd"
  parent       = "organizations/123456789012"
}

resource "google_folder" "prod" {
  display_name = "prod"
  parent       = google_folder.shopbd.name
}

resource "google_project" "prod_app" {
  name            = "shopbd prod"
  project_id      = "my-project-id"
  folder_id       = google_folder.prod.name
  billing_account = "000000-000000-000000"

  labels = {
    env = "prod"
    app = "shopbd"
  }
}
</code></pre>

Azure <pre><code>resource "azurerm_management_group" "shopbd" {
  display_name = "shopbd"
}

resource "azurerm_management_group_subscription_association" "prod" {
  management_group_id = azurerm_management_group.shopbd.id
  subscription_id     = "/subscriptions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

resource "azurerm_resource_group" "prod" {
  name     = "shopbd-prod-rg"
  location = "centralindia"

  tags = {
    env   = "prod"
    app   = "shopbd"
    owner = "ops@example.com"
  }
}
</code></pre>

OCI <pre><code>variable "tenancy_ocid" {
  type    = string
  default = "ocid1.tenancy.oc1..example"
}

resource "oci_identity_compartment" "shopbd" {
  compartment_id = var.tenancy_ocid
  name           = "shopbd"
  description    = "All shopbd resources"
  enable_delete  = true
}

resource "oci_identity_compartment" "prod" {
  compartment_id = oci_identity_compartment.shopbd.id
  name           = "shopbd-prod"
  description    = "shopbd production"
  enable_delete  = true
}
</code></pre> <p><code>enable_delete = true</code> না দিলে <code>terraform destroy</code>-এ compartment মুছবে না — Terraform শুধু state থেকে সরাবে। Compartment মোছার আগে ভেতর সম্পূর্ণ খালি থাকতে হবে।</p>

Key উদাহরণ কেন <code>app</code> <code>shopbd</code> কোন প্রজেক্ট <code>env</code> <code>prod</code> / <code>staging</code> / <code>dev</code> পরিবেশ <code>owner</code> <code>ops@example.com</code> কাকে জিজ্ঞেস করবেন <code>cost-center</code> <code>engineering</code> খরচ কোন খাতে <code>managed-by</code> <code>terraform</code> হাতে বানানো, না কোড থেকে AWSGCPAzureOCI <ul> <li>Tag key-value (সংখ্যা ও আকারে সীমা আছে, case-sensitive)।</li> <li>Cost allocation tag হিসেবে Billing console-এ activate না করলে খরচ রিপোর্টে tag দেখা যায় না — সবচেয়ে বেশি ভোলা ধাপ।</li> <li>Tag policy (Organizations): কোন key ও কোন মান বৈধ তা বাধ্য করা।</li> <li>Resource Groups Tagging API দিয়ে সব service জুড়ে tag খোঁজা যায়।</li> </ul> <pre><code>aws ec2 create-tags \
  --resources i-0123456789abcdef0 \
  --tags Key=env,Value=prod Key=app,Value=shopbd

aws resourcegroupstaggingapi get-resources \
  --tag-filters Key=app,Values=shopbd
</code></pre> <pre><code>provider "aws" {
  region = "ap-south-1"

  default_tags {
    tags = {
      app        = "shopbd"
      env        = "prod"
      managed-by = "terraform"
    }
  }
}
</code></pre> <p>GCP-তে দুই ধরনের জিনিস — বিভ্রান্তিকর, তাই মনোযোগ দিন:</p> <ul> <li>Label — key-value, খরচ ও filtering-এর জন্য (AWS tag-এর কাছাকাছি)। Billing export-এ দেখা যায়।</li> <li>Tag (Resource Manager tag) — organization/folder/project স্তরে নির্ধারিত structured key-value, যা IAM ও Organization Policy-র শর্তে ব্যবহার করা যায়। (এগুলো AWS tag নয়!)</li> <li>Network tag — একেবারে আলাদা: VM-এ বসানো চিহ্ন যা firewall rule-এর target হয় (05 · Networking)।</li> </ul> <pre><code>gcloud projects update my-project-id --update-labels=env=prod,app=shopbd
gcloud compute instances update shopbd-api-1 \
  --zone=asia-south1-a \
  --update-labels=env=prod
</code></pre> <pre><code>resource "google_compute_instance" "api" {
  # ... অন্যান্য আর্গুমেন্ট বাদ
  labels = {
    env = "prod"
    app = "shopbd"
  }
}
</code></pre> <ul> <li>Tag key-value, resource, resource group ও subscription-এ বসে।</li> <li>ডিফল্টে inherit হয় না — resource group-এ tag দিলে ভেতরের resource-এ আপনাআপনি যায় না। Azure Policy-র "inherit tag from resource group" ধরনের built-in policy দিয়ে বাধ্য করা যায়।</li> <li>Cost Management-এ tag ধরে খরচ filter ও group করা যায়।</li> </ul> <pre><code>az tag update --resource-id /subscriptions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/resourceGroups/shopbd-prod-rg \
  --operation merge --tags env=prod app=shopbd
</code></pre> <pre><code>resource "azurerm_storage_account" "images" {
  # ... অন্যান্য আর্গুমেন্ট বাদ
  tags = {
    env = "prod"
    app = "shopbd"
  }
}
</code></pre> <p>OCI-তে দুই ধরনের tag:</p> <ul> <li>Free-form tag — সাধারণ key-value, যেকোনো resource-এ, কোনো আগাম সংজ্ঞা ছাড়া।</li> <li>Defined tag — tag namespace-এর ভেতর আগে সংজ্ঞায়িত key (এবং সম্ভাব্য মানের তালিকা)। IAM policy-র শর্তে ও cost tracking-এ ব্যবহার করা যায়; tag default দিয়ে compartment-এ নতুন resource-এ স্বয়ংক্রিয়ভাবে বসানো যায়।</li> </ul> <pre><code>oci iam tag-namespace create \
  --compartment-id ocid1.tenancy.oc1..example \
  --name shopbd \
  --description "shopbd tags"
</code></pre> <pre><code>resource "oci_identity_tag_namespace" "shopbd" {
  compartment_id = var.tenancy_ocid
  name           = "shopbd"
  description    = "shopbd tags"
}

resource "oci_identity_tag" "env" {
  tag_namespace_id = oci_identity_tag_namespace.shopbd.id
  name             = "env"
  description      = "Environment"
}
</code></pre> <p>Tag-এর সাধারণ ফাঁদ</p> <ul> <li>নামের গোলমাল: <code>Env</code>, <code>env</code>, <code>environment</code> — আলাদা key গণ্য হয় (case-sensitive)। একটি naming standard লিখে রাখুন।</li> <li>সবকিছু ট্যাগ করা যায় না, আর কিছু resource-এর খরচ tag-এ ধরা পড়ে না (যেমন কিছু shared network খরচ)।</li> <li>Billing-এ active করা ভুলবেন না (AWS) / inherit হয় না (Azure) — ধরে নেবেন না যে tag নিজে থেকে কাজ করছে।</li> <li>Tag-এ secret বা ব্যক্তিগত তথ্য রাখবেন না — এগুলো billing ও log-এ দেখা যায়।</li> </ul>

AWS <pre><code>data "aws_iam_policy_document" "images_rw" {
  statement {
    actions   = ["s3:GetObject", "s3:PutObject"]
    resources = ["arn:aws:s3:::shopbd-images/*"]
  }
  statement {
    actions   = ["s3:ListBucket"]
    resources = ["arn:aws:s3:::shopbd-images"]
  }
}

data "aws_iam_policy_document" "ec2_trust" {
  statement {
    actions = ["sts:AssumeRole"]
    principals {
      type        = "Service"
      identifiers = ["ec2.amazonaws.com"]
    }
  }
}

resource "aws_iam_policy" "images_rw" {
  name   = "shopbd-images-rw"
  policy = data.aws_iam_policy_document.images_rw.json
}

resource "aws_iam_role" "api" {
  name               = "shopbd-api-role"
  assume_role_policy = data.aws_iam_policy_document.ec2_trust.json
}

resource "aws_iam_role_policy_attachment" "api_images" {
  role       = aws_iam_role.api.name
  policy_arn = aws_iam_policy.images_rw.arn
}

resource "aws_iam_instance_profile" "api" {
  name = "shopbd-api-profile"
  role = aws_iam_role.api.name
}
</code></pre>

GCP <pre><code>resource "google_service_account" "api" {
  account_id   = "shopbd-api"
  display_name = "shopbd API"
}

resource "google_storage_bucket_iam_member" "api_images" {
  bucket = "shopbd-images"
  role   = "roles/storage.objectUser"
  member = "serviceAccount:${google_service_account.api.email}"
}
</code></pre> <p><code>_binding</code>, <code>_member</code>, <code>_policy</code> — Terraform-এর তিন রূপ</p> <p><code>google_project_iam_member</code> একটি member যোগ করে (অন্যদের ছুঁয়ে না); <code>google_project_iam_binding</code> একটি role-এর সব member নিজের হাতে নেয়; <code>google_project_iam_policy</code> পুরো policy ওভাররাইট করে — নিজেকে তালাবন্ধ করতে পারেন। সাধারণত <code>_member</code> ব্যবহার করুন।</p>

Azure <pre><code>resource "azurerm_user_assigned_identity" "api" {
  name                = "shopbd-api-id"
  resource_group_name = azurerm_resource_group.prod.name
  location            = azurerm_resource_group.prod.location
}

resource "azurerm_role_assignment" "api_blob" {
  scope                = azurerm_storage_account.images.id
  role_definition_name = "Storage Blob Data Contributor"
  principal_id         = azurerm_user_assigned_identity.api.principal_id
}
</code></pre>

OCI <pre><code>resource "oci_identity_group" "developers" {
  compartment_id = var.tenancy_ocid
  name           = "shopbd-developers"
  description    = "shopbd developers"
}

resource "oci_identity_user" "dev1" {
  compartment_id = var.tenancy_ocid
  name           = "dev1"
  description    = "Developer 1"
  email          = "dev1@example.com"
}

resource "oci_identity_user_group_membership" "dev1" {
  user_id  = oci_identity_user.dev1.id
  group_id = oci_identity_group.developers.id
}

resource "oci_identity_dynamic_group" "api" {
  compartment_id = var.tenancy_ocid
  name           = "shopbd-api-dg"
  description    = "shopbd API instances"
  matching_rule  = "ALL {instance.compartment.id = '${oci_identity_compartment.prod.id}'}"
}

resource "oci_identity_policy" "api" {
  compartment_id = oci_identity_compartment.prod.id
  name           = "shopbd-api-policy"
  description    = "API access to images bucket"
  statements = [
    "Allow dynamic-group shopbd-api-dg to manage objects in compartment shopbd-prod where target.bucket.name = 'shopbd-images'",
  ]
}
</code></pre> <p>Dynamic group সম্পর্কে</p> <p>Dynamic group-এর নিজস্ব নাম-নির্ভর policy statement-এর রূপ identity domain ব্যবহার করলে <code>dynamic-group '&lt;DomainName&gt;'/'shopbd-api-dg'</code> রূপে লিখতে হতে পারে (Default domain-এর বাইরে)। আপনার tenancy-র domain-এর নিয়ম docs-এ মিলিয়ে নিন।</p>

AWSGCPAzureOCI <p>IAM OIDC provider + role যার trust policy GitHub token-এর শর্ত মেলায়।</p> <pre><code>resource "aws_iam_openid_connect_provider" "github" {
  url            = "https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com"
  client_id_list = ["sts.amazonaws.com"]
}

data "aws_iam_policy_document" "github_trust" {
  statement {
    actions = ["sts:AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity"]
    principals {
      type        = "Federated"
      identifiers = [aws_iam_openid_connect_provider.github.arn]
    }
    condition {
      test     = "StringEquals"
      variable = "token.actions.githubusercontent.com:aud"
      values   = ["sts.amazonaws.com"]
    }
    condition {
      test     = "StringLike"
      variable = "token.actions.githubusercontent.com:sub"
      values   = ["repo:my-org/shopbd:ref:refs/heads/main"]
    }
  }
}

resource "aws_iam_role" "github_deploy" {
  name               = "shopbd-github-deploy"
  assume_role_policy = data.aws_iam_policy_document.github_trust.json
}
</code></pre> <p>Workflow-তে <code>aws-actions/configure-aws-credentials</code> action (<code>role-to-assume</code>, <code>aws-region</code>) ব্যবহার করুন।</p> <p>Workload Identity Pool + Provider, তারপর service account-কে <code>roles/iam.workloadIdentityUser</code> দিন।</p> <pre><code>gcloud iam workload-identity-pools create github-pool \
  --project=my-project-id \
  --location=global \
  --display-name="GitHub"

gcloud iam workload-identity-pools providers create-oidc github-provider \
  --project=my-project-id \
  --location=global \
  --workload-identity-pool=github-pool \
  --issuer-uri="https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com" \
  --attribute-mapping="google.subject=assertion.sub,attribute.repository=assertion.repository" \
  --attribute-condition="assertion.repository=='my-org/shopbd'"

gcloud iam service-accounts add-iam-policy-binding \
  shopbd-deploy@my-project-id.iam.gserviceaccount.com \
  --role="roles/iam.workloadIdentityUser" \
  --member="principalSet://iam.googleapis.com/projects/123456789012/locations/global/workloadIdentityPools/github-pool/attribute.repository/my-org/shopbd"
</code></pre> <p>Workflow-তে <code>google-github-actions/auth</code> action (<code>workload_identity_provider</code>, <code>service_account</code>)।</p> <pre><code>resource "google_iam_workload_identity_pool" "github" {
  workload_identity_pool_id = "github-pool"
}

resource "google_iam_workload_identity_pool_provider" "github" {
  workload_identity_pool_id          = google_iam_workload_identity_pool.github.workload_identity_pool_id
  workload_identity_pool_provider_id = "github-provider"

  attribute_mapping = {
    "google.subject"       = "assertion.sub"
    "attribute.repository" = "assertion.repository"
  }
  attribute_condition = "assertion.repository == 'my-org/shopbd'"

  oidc {
    issuer_uri = "https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com"
  }
}
</code></pre> <p>Entra app registration (বা user-assigned managed identity)-এ federated credential যোগ করুন, তারপর সেই principal-কে RBAC role দিন।</p> <pre><code>{
  "name": "github-main",
  "issuer": "https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com",
  "subject": "repo:my-org/shopbd:ref:refs/heads/main",
  "audiences": ["api://AzureADTokenExchange"]
}
</code></pre> <pre><code>az ad app federated-credential create \
  --id &lt;app-object-id&gt; \
  --parameters credential.json
</code></pre> <p>Workflow-তে <code>azure/login</code> action (<code>client-id</code>, <code>tenant-id</code>, <code>subscription-id</code>) — কোনো client secret নেই।</p> <p>OCI-তে GitHub Actions থেকে keyless-এর পথ পরিবর্তনশীল: Identity domain-এর token exchange / identity propagation trust ধরনের ব্যবস্থায় বাইরের OIDC token-কে OCI-র অস্থায়ী token (UPST)-এ বদলানো যায়। নির্দিষ্ট সেটআপ ও CLI/Terraform রূপ docs-এর সংস্করণ-নির্ভর, তাই এখানে অনুমান করে কমান্ড দেওয়া হলো না — 15 · CI/CD ও DevOps-এ বর্তমান সমর্থিত উপায় দেখুন। মূলনীতি একই: long-lived API key-এর বদলে অস্থায়ী token। Kubernetes-এ OKE Workload Identity পাওয়া যায়।</p> <p>Subject/শর্ত সংকীর্ণ রাখুন</p> <p>শুধু <code>repo</code> নয়, branch বা environment-ও (<code>ref:refs/heads/main</code>) বাঁধুন। না হলে ওই organization-এর যেকোনো repo-র workflow আপনার role পেয়ে যেতে পারে।</p>

AWSGCPAzureOCI <pre><code>resource "aws_db_instance" "shopbd" {
  identifier                  = "shopbd-db"
  engine                      = "postgres"
  instance_class              = "db.t4g.medium"
  allocated_storage           = 50
  storage_type                = "gp3"
  db_name                     = "shopbd"
  username                    = "shopbdadmin"
  manage_master_user_password = true
  multi_az                    = true
  db_subnet_group_name        = aws_db_subnet_group.shopbd.name
  vpc_security_group_ids      = [aws_security_group.db.id]
  publicly_accessible         = false
  storage_encrypted           = true
  backup_retention_period     = 7
  deletion_protection         = true
  skip_final_snapshot         = false
  final_snapshot_identifier   = "shopbd-db-final"
}
</code></pre> <pre><code>resource "google_sql_database_instance" "shopbd" {
  name                = "shopbd-db"
  region              = "asia-south1"
  database_version    = "POSTGRES_16"
  deletion_protection = true

  settings {
    tier              = "db-custom-2-8192"
    edition           = "ENTERPRISE"
    availability_type = "REGIONAL"

    backup_configuration {
      enabled                        = true
      point_in_time_recovery_enabled = true
    }

    ip_configuration {
      ipv4_enabled    = false
      private_network = google_compute_network.shopbd.id
    }
  }
}
</code></pre> <pre><code>resource "azurerm_postgresql_flexible_server" "shopbd" {
  name                          = "shopbd-db"
  resource_group_name           = "shopbd-prod-rg"
  location                      = "centralindia"
  version                       = "16"
  sku_name                      = "GP_Standard_D2ds_v5"
  storage_mb                    = 131072
  delegated_subnet_id           = azurerm_subnet.db.id
  private_dns_zone_id           = azurerm_private_dns_zone.pg.id
  public_network_access_enabled = false
  administrator_login           = "shopbdadmin"
  administrator_password        = var.db_password
  backup_retention_days         = 7

  high_availability {
    mode = "ZoneRedundant"
  }
}
</code></pre> <pre><code>resource "oci_psql_db_system" "shopbd" {
  compartment_id              = var.compartment_id
  display_name                = "shopbd-db"
  db_version                  = "16"
  shape                       = "PostgreSQL.VM.Standard.E4.Flex.2.32GB"
  instance_count              = 1
  instance_ocpu_count         = 2
  instance_memory_size_in_gbs = 32

  network_details {
    subnet_id = oci_core_subnet.db.id
  }

  storage_details {
    is_regionally_durable = true
    system_type           = "OCI_OPTIMIZED_STORAGE"
  }

  credentials {
    username = "shopbdadmin"
    password_details {
      password_type = "PLAIN_TEXT"
      password      = var.db_password
    }
  }
}
</code></pre> <p>Shape ও version-এর অনুমোদিত মান region-ভেদে বদলায়; <code>oci psql shape list</code> ও Console-এ দেখে নিন।</p>

AWSGCPAzureOCI <pre><code>resource "aws_dynamodb_table" "carts" {
  name         = "shopbd-carts"
  billing_mode = "PAY_PER_REQUEST"
  hash_key     = "customer_id"

  attribute {
    name = "customer_id"
    type = "S"
  }

  point_in_time_recovery {
    enabled = true
  }

  ttl {
    attribute_name = "expires_at"
    enabled        = true
